(blessed Redeemer was born, to track His holy footsteps in His pilgrimage) Tj T*
(of mercy from place to place, to weep and bemoan Him on the site of the) Tj T*
(last closing scenes of His holy life, and to raise up their hearts with) Tj T*
(grateful thanksgivings for the great salvation wrought out for their) Tj T*
