(was ultimately married; and, for aught I know to the contrary, they are) Tj T*
(to this day a very loving and happy couple.  Strange to say, neither) Tj T*
(understood a word of each other?s language, and it would appear, from) Tj T*
(this example, that words are not necessary where such expressive things) Tj T*
(as eyes and flowers are brought into play.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
