(    ?Formerly when Baghdad was flourishing, when great men sometimes) Tj T*
(    condescended to sink themselves to a level with the common herd of) Tj T*
(    mankind, there lived and reigned the Sultan Houssein.  He was a) Tj T*
(    famous man and a just judge, but rather eccentric withal.  As his) Tj T*
