(villages are springing up; and, in addition to all this, the roads have) Tj T*
(been put into excellent order?not a trifling boon conferred upon the vast) Tj T*
(number of English travellers that are continually crossing this desert.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The steamers on the Nile, and the railway now in course of construction,) Tj T*
