(Abdallah Pasha, an Englishman who some time since embraced Mahomedanism,) Tj T*
(was appointed director of the transit, and the Pasha promoted him to that) Tj T*
(grade because he thought no one else competent to discharge the duties of) Tj T*
(the post.  The truth of the matter is, that the English never commanded) Tj T*
