(magnificent seat, placed in the midst of scenery of the most enchanting) Tj T*
(loveliness.  The noble park in which it stands studded with giant trees,) Tj T*
(that appear to be the children of centuries, spreads over a wide extent,) Tj T*
(and presents the most pleasing variety.  The grounds which more) Tj T*
(immediately surround it are beautifully laid out, and in their taste and) Tj T*
(arrangement reflect the character of its noble mistress.  The mansion) Tj T*
(itself is placed on the crest of a gentle hill; the splendour, the) Tj T*
