(gardener could not account for the depredations committed on his) Tj T*
(_potager_ till accident led him to discover the mystery.  One day he) Tj T*
(locked the gate before the princess returned from her morning walk, and) Tj T*
(consequently she remained there some considerable time, and had to) Tj T*
(breakfast and dine off her favourite vegetables.  At length, after a long) Tj T*
(search, the gardener heard her crying out, and accordingly released her.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
