(SYRIA.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is perhaps no country in the world which so much engages the) Tj T*
(attention of the Propaganda of Rome as Syria and the Holy Land.  To) Tj T*
(possess a leading influence on its destinies, has ever been the ambition) Tj T*
(of the Pope.  What could have been more iniquitous than the absurd) Tj T*
(pretensions of the Roman Catholics in the Jerusalem question?  It may be) Tj T*
(necessary to go back a little, and to acquaint the reader, that France) Tj T*
(has for many years claimed a sort of protection over the Romish Churches) Tj T*
(in Syria, and in periods of commotion in Mount Lebanon has exhibited the) Tj T*
(French colours from the convents, whilst all the appearance of state) Tj T*
(protection from the Propaganda has been kept up of late years, as must be) Tj T*
(well known in Europe.  Thus a perpetual excitement is created in Mount) Tj T*
(Lebanon, the Roman Catholics looking to France, the Greeks to Russia, and) Tj T*
(the Druses to England.  All this must be naturally displeasing to the) Tj T*
(Turkish government, and destructive to the country itself, whilst the) Tj T*
(agents of each of these parties are exciting them to perpetual outbreaks;) Tj T*
(and most disgraceful scenes are continually occurring at Jerusalem, even) Tj T*
(around the sepulchre of our blessed Lord; so that there is presented to) Tj T*
(Christendom, the melancholy spectacle of Turkish soldiers called in to) Tj T*
(prevent Christians massacring one another.  To increase the confusion,) Tj T*
(the last French ambassador at the Porte, M. Lavalette, demanded a renewal) Tj T*
(and ratification of some privileges, stated to be the substance of an old) Tj T*
(treaty with France, and so far succeeded as to obtain a promise from the) Tj T*
(ex-minister, Reschid Pasha, to comply with his wishes.  Pending the) Tj T*
(negotiation, however, the French minister being absent for a time, Russia) Tj T*
(went to work and had this promise set aside.  His Excellency M.) Tj T*
(Lavalette, returning and finding this, prepared to stand to his colours,) Tj T*
(and brought the _Charlemagne_ man-of-war to sustain his demand.  The) Tj T*
(grand vizier was called upon for an explanation, and as he could not) Tj T*
(defend his conduct, was dismissed from office, and the question thus) Tj T*
(remained in abeyance for months, but has now again been mooted.  France) Tj T*
(has got a renewal of the original privilege, whilst Russia continues) Tj T*
(obstinately to oppose these concessions.  The question is thus still at) Tj T*
(issue, and it is difficult to say how, when, or where it will end, unless) Tj T*
(England, as the only power best suited to do so, mediate between such) Tj T*
(conflicting parties.  At least such is my humble opinion. {371}  The Holy) Tj T*
(Sepulchre once exclusively in the possession of the Roman Catholics would) Tj T*
(indeed be a bright gem in the diadem of the Romish Church, the acme of) Tj T*
(their ambition, and a keystone to the hearts and affections of every) Tj T*
(Christian inhabitant in Syria; but though they have as yet failed in) Tj T*
(this, they have many other strongholds and fastnesses in the land.  Look) Tj T*
