(Sir Philip Grey Egerton has described a very remarkable fossil, viz., the) Tj T*
(Cyclobatis Oligodactylus, brought from Syria by Captain Graves, R.N., who) Tj T*
(kindly committed it to my care in 1845.  Altogether no fewer than) Tj T*
(thirty-four fossil fishes from Mount Lebanon are now known and described.) Tj T*
