(benevolence, but a contention between two parties for the exclusive) Tj T*
(possession of the fees obtained from pious pilgrims visiting spots, whose) Tj T*
(situation if precisely ascertained, would be doubly calculated to make an) Tj T*
(impression never to be effaced from the minds of those who tread them;) Tj T*
